    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sam",
      "key": "GreenRain",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Whaa! Is it acid? Will it burn through the roof and sizzle us alive?$8#$b#I gotta keep my little brother safe!$7",
      "translation": "Cože! Je to kyselina? Proleptá střechu a usmaží nás zaživa?$8#$b#Musím ochránit svého malého brášku!$7",
