    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sam",
      "key": "married_Sebastian",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Wow, I can't believe you and Sebastian got hitched. Times really are changing...$u#$e#Eh, it's alright, I'm sure he'll still have time to hang out.",
      "translation": "Páni, nemůžu uvěřit, že jste se se Sebastianem vzali. Časy se vážně mění...$u#$e#Eh, je to v pohodě. Určitě bude mít pořád čas se mnou někam vyrazit.",
      "sourceSHA256": "962dce5badb04316e5cef48acdc7e6f1305504dda0637ab2d736b82131e95dad",
      "translationSHA256": "fbc4d765e8fbba117267518d0516226af7b6e8b2eddf8aee19d1332b4cb91719",
