    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sam",
      "key": "married_Abigail",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, what's the big idea? You took my drummer!$8#$b#Haha, just kidding... Congrats!$h",
      "translation": "Hej, co to má znamenat? Kvůli tobě jsem přišel o bubenici!$8#$b#Haha, jen si dělám legraci... Gratuluji!$h",
