    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sam",
      "key": "firstVisit_Sewer",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Heheh... So you've been to the sewer, huh? I've snuck down there a few times myself. It's pretty creepy.#$e#How could I tell? Hmm... let's just say... 'the nose knows'.$h",
      "translation": "Hehehe... Takže už znáš Kanalizaci, co? Sám jsem se tam párkrát vplížil. Je to tam pěkně děsivé.#$e#Jak jsem to poznal? Hmm... Řekněme jen, že... ‚nos ví své‘.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "d9b17673f3df07b7daa742e262153c8ce69588600342bd7bd8d558416762f9f3",
      "translationSHA256": "d71e9708c4c1d3ee5da4893ef2375088f973b478e47f161f4f51f25d49c366ef",
